# Navigation order for the subject taxonomy -- see about/our-taxonomy.md.
# Without this, awesome-pages sorts alphabetically and opens the site on
# christian-life, scattering the doctrinal teaching order.
#
# The top level is grouped, and mkdocs.yml's navigation.sections feature renders each group as a
# caption in the sidebar with its sections listed under it (the look of mkdocs-material's own
# documentation). A group here is a title only: it adds no directory, so no URL changes.
nav:
  - index.md
  # The doctrinal teaching order.
  - Topics:
    - scripture
    - god
    - jesus
    - holy-spirit
    - biblical-figures
    - spiritual-beings
    - sin
    - salvation
    - israel-and-church
    - chronology
    - last-things
    - feasts
    - christian-life
    - wisdom
    # The chapter-by-chapter index of every book, linking the studies that treat each chapter.
    - commentaries
  # The interactive tools: ordinary mkdocs pages with a React
  # bundle mounted into each (built by `npm run build:tools` in app/). references.md leads: it is
  # the one a reader reaches for while actually studying a passage.
  - Explore:
    - references.md
    - timeline.md
  - Learn:
    - hebrew
    - greek
    # A lookup surface rather than a section: short definitions that link out to the page owning
    # each term.
    - glossary.md
  # Teaching material, then personal notes and testimony, kept apart from the studies.
  - Teaching and writing:
    - teaching
    - blog
  - About this site:
    - faq.md
    - resources
    - about
